{
  "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.26,
      "size": 52128,
      "text": "阿基米德立体的说法是十三种。但翻开教科书你会看到一句附注：不含棱柱与反棱柱。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.28,
      "size": 52416,
      "text": "这两族同样满足条件：所有面都是正多边形，所有顶点长得一样。凭什么被排除在外？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.77,
      "size": 60336,
      "text": "原因很实在：它们各有无穷多个。边数可以取三、四、五一直数下去，没有尽头，所以只能单列成族。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "prism",
      "line_id": "pr-1",
      "filename": "prism-pr-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/prism-pr-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.35,
      "size": 37584,
      "text": "棱柱最简单：上下两个正多边形底面，侧面用长方形连起来。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "prism",
      "line_id": "pr-2",
      "filename": "prism-pr-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/prism-pr-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65376,
      "text": "但要让侧面是正方形，高度必须恰好等于底面边长。外接圆半径取一时，边长是二倍正弦圆周率除以边数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "prism",
      "line_id": "pr-3",
      "filename": "prism-pr-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/prism-pr-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.47,
      "size": 55584,
      "text": "数一数：顶点两倍边数，棱三倍边数，面是边数加二。代进欧拉公式，抵消后恰好得二。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "antiprism",
      "line_id": "ap-1",
      "filename": "antiprism-ap-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/antiprism-ap-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.17,
      "size": 50688,
      "text": "反棱柱的关键在一个巧妙的错位：把上底面绕轴转过半个角，也就是圆周率除以边数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "antiprism",
      "line_id": "ap-2",
      "filename": "antiprism-ap-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/antiprism-ap-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.03,
      "size": 48528,
      "text": "错开之后，上下顶点不再正对，侧面自然被分割成三角形，一圈共两倍边数个。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "antiprism",
      "line_id": "ap-3",
      "filename": "antiprism-ap-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/antiprism-ap-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.81,
      "size": 60912,
      "text": "高度要重新算。要让三角形等边，用勾股定理：高的平方等于底边长平方减去错开后的水平距离平方。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-1",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/degenerate-dg-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.65,
      "size": 42336,
      "text": "有趣的是这两族里各藏着一个柏拉图立体。把棱柱的边数取四会怎样？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-2",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/degenerate-dg-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.11,
      "size": 49824,
      "text": "四边形底面加四个正方形侧面，一共六个正方形，正是立方体。顶点棱面都对得上。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "degenerate",
      "line_id": "dg-3",
      "filename": "degenerate-dg-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/degenerate-dg-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.87,
      "size": 61920,
      "text": "反棱柱取三更妙：三角形底面加六个三角侧面，八个三角面，那就是正八面体。屏幕上可以逐项核对。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "volume",
      "line_id": "vl-1",
      "filename": "volume-vl-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/volume-vl-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.05,
      "size": 48816,
      "text": "现在看一个反直觉的现象。固定外接圆半径，让边数从三一直加大，体积怎么变？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "volume",
      "line_id": "vl-2",
      "filename": "volume-vl-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/volume-vl-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.74,
      "size": 59904,
      "text": "直觉说底面越来越接近圆，体积该越来越大。但实测在边数等于四时体积达到最大，之后一路下降。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "volume",
      "line_id": "vl-3",
      "filename": "volume-vl-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/volume-vl-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.64,
      "size": 74304,
      "text": "原因在高度。侧面要是正方形，高度就等于边长，而边数越大边长越小。底面变大但被压得越扁，最终趋于一张薄片。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.52,
      "size": 40320,
      "text": "第一，棱柱与反棱柱各有无穷多个，因此被单列而不计入十三种。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.45,
      "size": 39168,
      "text": "第二，反棱柱靠上底面错开半个角，把侧面分割成等边三角形。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "prism-antiprism",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/prism-antiprism/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.28,
      "size": 68544,
      "text": "第三，四棱柱是立方体，三反棱柱是正八面体，而体积在边数为四时达到峰值。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
